WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.816
Rain fell hard.

2
00:00:06.817 --> 00:00:21.206
The buddies were getting soaked.

3
00:00:21.206 --> 00:00:24.648
Rex looked down at the river.

4
00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:29.931
The river was moving fast.

5
00:00:29.932 --> 00:00:33.833
"I see a tree," Rex said.

6
00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:36.225
"Let's hide under it.

7
00:00:36.226 --> 00:00:40.093
It has wide leaves."

8
00:00:40.094 --> 00:00:45.803
"Good idea!" Tor said.

9
00:00:45.804 --> 00:00:52.106
The buddies went down the hill.

10
00:00:52.107 --> 00:00:55.621
The hill was steep and muddy.

11
00:00:55.622 --> 00:01:03.899
The buddies slipped in the mud.

12
00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:09.487
"Ugh!" Sid said.

13
00:01:09.488 --> 00:01:13.527
"Eww!" Rex frowned.

14
00:01:13.528 --> 00:01:17.933
"Mud went in my mouth!"

15
00:01:17.934 --> 00:01:24.239
"Yuck!" Sara wiped mud off her face.

16
00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:31.409
Tor sighed. "Now we're wet—and muddy!"

17
00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:36.142
The rain poured down harder.

18
00:01:36.142 --> 00:01:41.872
The rain washed the mud off.

19
00:01:41.872 --> 00:01:50.210
"Yay!" Sara said.

20
00:01:50.211 --> 00:01:54.144
The buddies sat under the tree.

21
00:01:54.145 --> 00:01:57.684
"It's nice under here," Sara said.

22
00:01:57.685 --> 00:02:04.556
Tor smiled. "It's dry!"

23
00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:09.087
"Shh!" Rex said suddenly.

24
00:02:09.087 --> 00:02:11.974
"I hear someone."

25
00:02:11.975 --> 00:02:15.140
Everyone listened.

26
00:02:15.141 --> 00:02:21.132
A voice cried, "Help!"

